OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWednesday
OL,6,Fnight is expected to be cloudy and
OL,7,Fbreezy, with most areas remaining
OL,8,Frather mild. Dry conditions are likely
OL,9,Fto persist across the region
OL,10,Fthroughout the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy and rather warm for
OL,13,Fmuch of Thursday, with most areas
OL,14,Fstaying dry throughout the day. A band
OL,15,Fof rain then moves across the region
OL,16,Fovernight. Breezy until later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
